# Antigravity Agent Harness Gap Audit

Generated: 2026-05-27

Scope: compare the current Autopilot Agent Studio / Rust default harness state against the Antigravity agent harness described in `internal-docs/reverse-engineering`.

This is not a re-run of the default harness parity campaign. That campaign closed the default Rust tool catalogue rows. This audit asks a larger question: what Antigravity-grade harness primitives remain missing, partial, or unproven now that default harness parity is green?

